        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a brave chicken on a quest for revenge to reclaim your eggs deep within the Stealing Eggs Corporation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/559926b6a41a9df0d9104085bd9ca72c.poster.avif?t=1759344128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/559926b6a41a9df0d9104085bd9ca72c.webm?t=1759344128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/559926b6a41a9df0d9104085bd9ca72c.mp4?t=1759344128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A challenging journey:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend floor by floor and face increasingly difficult obstacles. Each level will test your agility and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/0376bb5b709e331f8fb38ceba02cc6a1.poster.avif?t=1759344128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/0376bb5b709e331f8fb38ceba02cc6a1.webm?t=1759344128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/0376bb5b709e331f8fb38ceba02cc6a1.mp4?t=1759344128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Try, fail, retry:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is part of the game, so be prepared to restart and refine your moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/97f0cc6351848eb0b498bd15c2a6ca3d.poster.avif?t=1759344128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/97f0cc6351848eb0b498bd15c2a6ca3d.webm?t=1759344128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/97f0cc6351848eb0b498bd15c2a6ca3d.mp4?t=1759344128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The challenge:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to recover all your eggs and triumph over the Stealing Eggs Corporation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>A Chicken in the Office</strong> is a 3D platformer, puzzle, and die &amp; retry game where you play as a chicken determined to retrieve its eggs stolen by the mysterious <strong>StealingEggsCorporation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore offices across multiple floors, each progressively more challenging, and face unique challenges on every level. You will need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive employees and unpredictable traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve clever puzzles to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve each egg and complete the objectives of each floor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers two difficulty levels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong>: perfect for discovering the gameplay and enjoying the adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode</strong>: for players seeking a true challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor represents a new level with its own challenges. Playtime ranges from 1 to 4 hours, depending on your ability to solve puzzles quickly and the selected difficulty mode.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a chicken and experience a surprising and original adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied offices: each floor offers a new challenge to overcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humor and unpredictability: expect unexpected and amusing situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal and Hard modes: adjust the challenge to your skill level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo mode only: a focused experience on gameplay and puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Good luck!</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a brave chicken on a quest for revenge to reclaim your eggs deep within the Stealing Eggs Corporation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/559926b6a41a9df0d9104085bd9ca72c.poster.avif?t=1759344128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/559926b6a41a9df0d9104085bd9ca72c.webm?t=1759344128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/559926b6a41a9df0d9104085bd9ca72c.mp4?t=1759344128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A challenging journey:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend floor by floor and face increasingly difficult obstacles. Each level will test your agility and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/0376bb5b709e331f8fb38ceba02cc6a1.poster.avif?t=1759344128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/0376bb5b709e331f8fb38ceba02cc6a1.webm?t=1759344128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/0376bb5b709e331f8fb38ceba02cc6a1.mp4?t=1759344128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Try, fail, retry:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is part of the game, so be prepared to restart and refine your moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/97f0cc6351848eb0b498bd15c2a6ca3d.poster.avif?t=1759344128\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/97f0cc6351848eb0b498bd15c2a6ca3d.webm?t=1759344128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996720/extras/97f0cc6351848eb0b498bd15c2a6ca3d.mp4?t=1759344128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The challenge:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to recover all your eggs and triumph over the Stealing Eggs Corporation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>A Chicken in the Office</strong> is a 3D platformer, puzzle, and die &amp; retry game where you play as a chicken determined to retrieve its eggs stolen by the mysterious <strong>StealingEggsCorporation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore offices across multiple floors, each progressively more challenging, and face unique challenges on every level. You will need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive employees and unpredictable traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve clever puzzles to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve each egg and complete the objectives of each floor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers two difficulty levels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong>: perfect for discovering the gameplay and enjoying the adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode</strong>: for players seeking a true challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor represents a new level with its own challenges. Playtime ranges from 1 to 4 hours, depending on your ability to solve puzzles quickly and the selected difficulty mode.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a chicken and experience a surprising and original adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied offices: each floor offers a new challenge to overcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humor and unpredictability: expect unexpected and amusing situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal and Hard modes: adjust the challenge to your skill level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo mode only: a focused experience on gameplay and puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Good luck!</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "A Chicken In The Office is a single-player game where you play as a chicken who has lost everything. Recover your eggs, make your way through each floor, and take revenge on the Stealing Eggs Corporation!",
